ir of shoes).\nMàu sắc đứng trước danh từ: \"a red dress\" (một cái váy đỏ). Hỏi màu: \"What color is it?\"\nTrả tiền: pay in cash (tiền mặt) / pay by card (bằng thẻ). \"Expensive\" (đắt) ↔ \"cheap\" (rẻ).","lessonId":"u9n5l3","lessonVersion":"v2.u9n5l3","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u9n5","order":68,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u9n5l3","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"Y4qzEkAPTvFSWXbdJ0xE3stv62GFqKQAZ0Hp88d1_TZLILzppsZo2JUqhFc5Q34dU8ATKsAkOrAjZUuPcfEzCg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["listening","u9.grammar","u9.vocab"],"title":"Trả tiền · Bài 3","unitId":"u9"}